{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20145","headline":"赠竟陵卢使君虔别 · 孟郊","name":"赠竟陵卢使君虔别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤日千里火，火中行子心。\n孰不苦焦灼，所行爲贫侵。\n山木岂无凉，猛兽蹲清阴。\n归人忆平坦，别路多岖嶔。\n赖得竟陵守，时闻建安吟。\n赠别折楚芳，楚芳摇衣襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}